    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install anythingllm
```

Chocolatey downloads the official 64-bit installer at install time and runs it silently. The package itself carries no binaries.

Install a specific version:

```powershell
choco install anythingllm --version=<version>
```

## What is AnythingLLM Desktop?

Stop renting your intelligence. Own it with AnythingLLM. Everything you need for a powerful local-first agent experience.

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade anythingllm
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall anythingllm
```

